 "The image is a bar chart illustrating year-on-year percentage changes for hydrocarbon and non-hydrocarbon sectors. \n\n- **Axes**: The vertical axis represents the percentage change from -2% to 10%, while the horizontal axis breaks down the data by year.\n  \n- **Bars**: \n  - The **hydrocarbon** sector is represented by solid blue bars, indicating various percentage changes over the specified years.\n  - The **non-hydrocarbon** sector is shown as striped bars (in a lighter shade), also reflecting changes over the same years.\n\n- **Data Representation**: The chart includes several bars for both categories, allowing for an easy visual comparison of trends between hydrocarbon and non-hydrocarbon sectors across the selected years.\n\nOverall, the chart is designed to convey statistical data likely relevant to economic discussions or analyses pertaining to Qatar's economy, specifically focusing on its hydrocarbon and non-hydrocarbon industries.",
